FORMAT: 1A
HOST: https://api.simkl.com

# SIMKL API Documentation

The SIMKL API provides access to anime, TV shows, and movies database with tracking, search, and user interaction capabilities.

## Authentication

The SIMKL API uses OAuth 2.0 for authentication. You'll need to register your application to get client credentials.

### OAuth Flow
1. Register application at https://simkl.com/settings/developer
2. Get authorization code from user
3. Exchange code for access token
4. Use access token for API requests

## Base URL
All API requests should be made to: `https://api.simkl.com`

## Rate Limiting
- 1000 requests per hour for authenticated requests
- 100 requests per hour for unauthenticated requests

---

# Group Authentication

## Get Access Token [POST /oauth/token]

Exchange authorization code for access token.

+ Request (application/json)
    + Headers
            Content-Type: application/json
    + Body
            {
                "code": "authorization_code_here",
                "client_id": "your_client_id",
                "client_secret": "your_client_secret",
                "redirect_uri": "your_redirect_uri",
                "grant_type": "authorization_code"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Body
            {
                "access_token": "access_token_here",
                "token_type": "Bearer",
                "scope": "public"
            }

---

# Group Search

## Search Movies/TV Shows/Anime [GET /search/{type}]

Search for content by title.

+ Parameters
    + type (required, string) - Content type: `movie`, `show`, `anime`
    + q (required, string) - Search query
    + limit (optional, number) - Number of results (default: 20, max: 50)

+ Request
    + Headers
            Authorization: Bearer access_token_here
            Content-Type: application/json
            simkl-api-key: your_api_key

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Body
            [
                {
                    "title": "Attack on Titan",
                    "year": 2013,
                    "ids": {
                        "simkl": 8691,
                        "imdb": "tt2560140",
                        "tmdb": 1429,
                        "anidb": 9541,
                        "anilist": 16498,
                        "mal": 16498
                    },
                    "poster": "https://simkl.in/posters/8691_m.jpg",
                    "fanart": "https://simkl.in/fanart/8691_medium.jpg",
                    "first_aired": "2013-04-07",
                    "total_episodes": 25,
                    "status": "ended",
                    "genres": ["Action", "Drama", "Fantasy"],
                    "overview": "Humanity fights for survival against giant humanoid Titans.",
                    "rating": 9.0,
                    "votes": 45236,
                    "runtime": 24,
                    "country": "jp",
                    "network": "MBS",
                    "trailer": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=...",
                    "anime_type": "tv"
                }
            ]

