# Group Content Details

## Get Content Details [GET /{type}/{id}]

Get detailed information about specific content.

+ Parameters
    + type (required, string) - Content type: `movies`, `shows`, `anime`
    + id (required, number) - SIMKL ID of the content

+ Request
    + Headers
            Authorization: Bearer access_token_here
            Content-Type: application/json
            simkl-api-key: your_api_key

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Body
            {
                "title": "Attack on Titan",
                "year": 2013,
                "ids": {
                    "simkl": 8691,
                    "imdb": "tt2560140",
                    "tmdb": 1429,
                    "anidb": 9541,
                    "anilist": 16498,
                    "mal": 16498
                },
                "poster": "https://simkl.in/posters/8691_m.jpg",
                "fanart": "https://simkl.in/fanart/8691_medium.jpg",
                "first_aired": "2013-04-07",
                "last_aired": "2023-11-04",
                "total_episodes": 25,
                "aired_episodes": 25,
                "status": "ended",
                "genres": ["Action", "Drama", "Fantasy"],
                "overview": "Humanity fights for survival against giant humanoid Titans that have brought humanity to the brink of extinction.",
                "rating": 9.0,
                "votes": 45236,
                "runtime": 24,
                "country": "jp",
                "network": "MBS",
                "trailer": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=...",
                "anime_type": "tv",
                "episodes": [
                    {
                        "episode": 1,
                        "title": "To You, in 2000 Years: The Fall of Shiganshina, Part 1",
                        "description": "After 100 years of peace, humanity faces a new threat.",
                        "aired": "2013-04-07",
                        "runtime": 24,
                        "ids": {
                            "simkl": 869101
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }

## Get Episodes [GET /{type}/{id}/episodes]

Get episode list for a show or anime.

+ Parameters
    + type (required, string) - Content type: `shows` or `anime`
    + id (required, number) - SIMKL ID of the content

+ Request
    + Headers
            Authorization: Bearer access_token_here
            Content-Type: application/json
            simkl-api-key: your_api_key

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Body
            [
                {
                    "episode": 1,
                    "title": "To You, in 2000 Years: The Fall of Shiganshina, Part 1",
                    "description": "After 100 years of peace, humanity faces a new threat.",
                    "aired": "2013-04-07",
                    "runtime": 24,
                    "ids": {
                        "simkl": 869101,
                        "imdb": "tt2707832",
                        "tmdb": 63055
                    }
                },
                {
                    "episode": 2,
                    "title": "That Day: The Fall of Shiganshina, Part 2",
                    "description": "Eren vows to eliminate every Titan.",
                    "aired": "2013-04-14",
                    "runtime": 24,
                    "ids": {
                        "simkl": 869102,
                        "imdb": "tt2707834",
                        "tmdb": 63056
                    }
                }
            ]

