# Group User Library

## Get User Watching [GET /sync/all-items/{type}/watching]

Get user's currently watching content.

+ Parameters
    + type (required, string) - Content type: `movies`, `shows`, `anime`

+ Request
    + Headers
            Authorization: Bearer access_token_here
            Content-Type: application/json
            simkl-api-key: your_api_key

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Body
            [
                {
                    "last_watched_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
                    "seasons": [
                        {
                            "number": 1,
                            "episodes": [
                                {
                                    "number": 5,
                                    "watched_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "show": {
                        "title": "Attack on Titan",
                        "year": 2013,
                        "ids": {
                            "simkl": 8691
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]

## Add to Watching [POST /sync/history]

Mark content as watched or add to watching list.

+ Request (application/json)
    + Headers
            Authorization: Bearer access_token_here
            Content-Type: application/json
            simkl-api-key: your_api_key
    + Body
            {
                "shows": [
                    {
                        "ids": {
                            "simkl": 8691
                        },
                        "seasons": [
                            {
                                "number": 1,
                                "episodes": [
                                    {
                                        "number": 1,
                                        "watched_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "movies": [
                    {
                        "ids": {
                            "simkl": 12345
                        },
                        "watched_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
                    }
                ]
            }

+ Response 201 (application/json)
    + Body
            {
                "added": {
                    "shows": 1,
                    "seasons": 1,
                    "episodes": 1,
                    "movies": 1
                },
                "existing": {
                    "shows": 0,
                    "seasons": 0,
                    "episodes": 0,
                    "movies": 0
                },
                "not_found": {
                    "shows": [],
                    "seasons": [],
                    "episodes": [],
                    "movies": []
                }
            }

