# Group Recommendations

## Get Recommendations [GET /sync/recommendations/{type}]

Get personalized recommendations based on user's watch history.

+ Parameters
    + type (required, string) - Content type: `movies`, `shows`, `anime`
    + limit (optional, number) - Number of results (default: 10, max: 50)

+ Request
    + Headers
            Authorization: Bearer access_token_here
            Content-Type: application/json
            simkl-api-key: your_api_key

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Body
            [
                {
                    "title": "Demon Slayer",
                    "year": 2019,
                    "ids": {
                        "simkl": 347060
                    },
                    "poster": "https://simkl.in/posters/347060_m.jpg",
                    "rating": 8.7,
                    "genres": ["Action", "Supernatural"],
                    "reason": "Because you watched Attack on Titan"
                }
            ]

