# Data Structures

## Content Object
+ title (string) - Title of the content
+ year (number) - Release year
+ ids (object) - External IDs (simkl, imdb, tmdb, anidb, anilist, mal)
+ poster (string) - Poster image URL
+ fanart (string) - Fanart image URL
+ first_aired (string) - First air date (ISO 8601)
+ total_episodes (number) - Total number of episodes
+ status (string) - Status: ended, continuing, upcoming, canceled
+ genres (array) - Array of genre strings
+ overview (string) - Content description
+ rating (number) - User rating (0-10)
+ votes (number) - Number of votes
+ runtime (number) - Episode/movie runtime in minutes
+ country (string) - Country code
+ network (string) - Network/studio name
+ trailer (string) - Trailer URL
+ anime_type (string) - For anime: tv, movie, special, ova, ona

## Episode Object
+ episode (number) - Episode number
+ title (string) - Episode title
+ description (string) - Episode description
+ aired (string) - Air date (ISO 8601)
+ runtime (number) - Episode runtime in minutes
+ ids (object) - External IDs